From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dylan Ironside <dylan@dylanironside.io>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 04:57:33 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 352/353] arm64: dts: apple: t8132-j604: add the ADT power
 gates for suspend

Copy the J604 ADT's /arm-io/pmgr pwrgate-regs (macOS 26B123) into the
suspend-to-RAM node as apple,pwrgate-regs, with the pmgr0 and pmgr1
windows they index (pmgr reg[0] and reg[1]).

tools/asahi/t8132-pwrgate-adt-tests.py checks the records against the
ADT's, that each lies in its window, and the driver's read, gated write
and undo.

Assisted-by: LLM
Signed-off-by: Dylan Ironside <dylan@dylanironside.io>
